       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INTEREST.
*> Compound interest, applied once per year.
*> Traps for a naive translation:
*>   - fixed-point money (PIC 9(7)V99), never floats
*>   - ROUNDED is applied every year, not only at the end
*>   - the result field silently loses high-order digits on overflow
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-PRINCIPAL   PIC X(20).
01 WS-IN-RATE        PIC X(20).
01 WS-IN-YEARS       PIC X(20).
01 WS-PRINCIPAL      PIC 9(7)V99.
01 WS-RATE           PIC 9(3)V99.
01 WS-YEARS          PIC 99.
01 WS-BALANCE        PIC 9(7)V99.
01 WS-YEAR-IDX       PIC 99.
01 WS-OUT            PIC Z(6)9.99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-PRINCIPAL
    ACCEPT WS-IN-RATE
    ACCEPT WS-IN-YEARS
    COMPUTE WS-PRINCIPAL = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-IN-PRINCIPAL)
    COMPUTE WS-RATE = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-IN-RATE)
    COMPUTE WS-YEARS = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-IN-YEARS)
    MOVE WS-PRINCIPAL TO WS-BALANCE
    PERFORM VARYING WS-YEAR-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-YEAR-IDX > WS-YEARS
        COMPUTE WS-BALANCE ROUNDED = WS-BALANCE * (1 + WS-RATE / 100)
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE WS-BALANCE TO WS-OUT
    DISPLAY "BALANCE: " WS-OUT
    STOP RUN.
